# ============================================================================
# SANCHALA OS - FIDO2 User Key Mappings
# ============================================================================
# Format: <username>:<keyhandle1>:<pubkey1>:<keyhandle2>:<pubkey2>:...
# Generated by: sanchala-fido2 enroll
#
# This file maps users to their registered FIDO2 authenticators
# Keys are stored in base64 format
#
# Example:
# alice:QUVTMjU2R0NN...:ecdsa-sha2-nistp256 AAAA...
# bob:keyhandle1:pubkey1:keyhandle2:pubkey2
#
# Security: This file should be owned by root:root with mode 0600
# Keys registered here can authenticate as the mapped user
# ============================================================================

# System-wide FIDO2 key registrations
# Add entries using: sanchala-fido2 enroll <username>
# Remove entries using: sanchala-fido2 revoke <username> <key-id>

# Example entries (commented):
# admin:Qi4rB3LnPzXm...:ecdsa-sha2-nistp256 AAAAE2VjZHNh...
